ing for her this is a pretty  bold statement and since Hyrum is in  jail his plan probably has to do with  inmates shockingly Hyrum was sent to his  very own prison where he has some pretty  major influence and it appears as though  chick was also sent to Hiram's  penitentiary it's safe to say that Hyrum  is going to hit Veronica where it hurts  right in the wallet seconds before  Hermione was arrested she was speaking  to someone on the phone and said how  could this so we can definitely expect  to find out about Hyrum secret in season  4 could Hyrum owe people money or be  running a drug front that could  potentially land Veronica and jail  whatever the case may be we don't  foresee Hyrum staying in jail for too  long he might siege a prison break and  SiC some of Riverdale's finest criminals  on Veronica and her friends while making  his great escape surprise surprise Edgar  ever never isn't the peaceful guru he's  been pretending to be the farmer is a  front  Kevin fangs by the time buddy in the  ganga rive at the sisters of quiet mercy  everyone is m.i.a except for kevin their  white clothes are left in heaps on the  floor giving the illusion that edgar and  his many wives spontaneously disappeared  but we know better than that  Alice helped Cheryl escape the sisters  of quiet Mercy through a tunnel that led  to Fox Forest  however this tunnel used to be bricked  up but according to Alice Edgar had it  reopened when he bought the compound  could this be how Edgar and the farm  managed to disappear without using the  front entrance  Edgar might be moving the farm to a new  town or selling off his followers one by  one whatever the case may be executive  producer Roberto aguirre-sacasa  confirmed during an interview with E W  that the missing people case would be  resolved early on in  season four chances are kevin was made  to stay back because his kidney had  already been taken out do you guys think  the farms inhabitants are going to wake  up in Fox forests with some missing  organs  yikes we sure hope not fans have been  curious to find out if chick was telling  Betty the truth when he confessed to  killing Charles and stealing his  identity well lo and behold chick is a  liar big shocker there Charles Smith is  an FBI agent who's been working with his  estranged mother Alice to catch edgar  ever never in the act he made his first  ever appearance at the end of the season  three finale and let's just say that his  mere existence makes things super  awkward for bug head and since barchi is  back together we can only expect that  bug head will call it quits in season  four but their separation probably won't  last for the entire season during the  same interview with E W Roberto revealed  that Charles has some secrets of his own  and that a good portion of season four  will circle around Betty and her serial  killer gene that he has been fighting  her dark side for a long time now and it  looks like she's about to breathe could  her dark side be what leads to jugheads  alleged death midway through season four  yeah we're not too sure about that  either but it's safe to say that the  poor four are going to have to cover up  a murder in the upcoming season oddly  enough Charles doesn't seem to be a  cause for concern after all Roberto also  told ET online that Charles and Betty  would go on to have a positive  relationship so could Betty murder  someone to protect Charles in a  desperate attempt to salvage what's left  of her family or is Roberto trying to  throw us off Charles's trail it wouldn't  be the first time Riverdale led us to  believe that Jughead Jones had kicked  the bucket so fans are pretty much  convinced that Jughead is alive and well  but why wasn't he around the bonfire and  why were his friends burning his beanie  well the only thing that makes sense to  us is that Jughead murdered someone and  is too injured to cover up his tracks so  his friends are taking care of the body  for him if some of the victim